In this project we were instructed to write queries for a relational database in Dbeaver (Guitar shop which we were provided the code for). The queries that I wrote were designed based on the information that we where give in the lab document.

I created a file called query.sql that hold all the query that we were instructed to write.

To excute this script you have guitershop database set up in  the cloud computing brightspace under sql scripts. After that you need to right click on "my_guitar_shop" then select "SQL editor" and select "New SQL script". Then copy and paste the whole query.sql in the DBeaver. To run each script to have to select each query independently ( the queries are seperated by a line) and "Excute SQL Script". 

Screenshots can be found in the screenshots folder under lab 4 